      "title": "Total organic agricultural area (SCP Indicator 1B)",
      "description": "This indicator measures the share of a country's total agricultural area that is certified organic or in conversion to organic agriculture. This indicator is tracked by MedWaves (UNEP/MAP SCP/RAC) and is part of the Regional Action Plan on Sustainable Consumption and Production (SCP) in the Mediterranean. For more information, please check the SCP Factsheet n.1 (Productive and sustainable agriculture) available at https://switchmed.eu/policy/indicator-factsheets-on-scp-in-the-mediterranean/ [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal kmap_inforac]",
